url: https://manga.nicovideo.jp/comic/82261
why: '私の女神が今日も推せる 【単話版】. Every rendered episode carries `アプリで読める`, so the

  listing offers no web reading anywhere: it is the phone app selling one chapter
  at a time of a book

  already published. Its own listing says the content is that of `comicGAGA VOL.1`,
  and the work

  holds a BOOK☆WALKER volume record independently.


  THE HEADER IS KEPT BECAUSE IT IS NOT WHAT DECIDES THIS. `meta_info` states the work-level
  badge in

  place of the usual `[ N話 無料 ]`, and reading the route off it would be wrong on the
  108 works whose

  opening chapters a browser can still open. The tiles decide it. Three episodes are
  enough to show

  they agree.'
---
